---
---
<section class="benefits" aria-label="Переваги">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="benefits__grid">
      <article class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="44" height="44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 21.5 7.5v9L12 22 2.5 16.5v-9L12 2Z" /><path d="M12 8v8" /><path d="M8.5 10.5 12 8l3.5 2.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Власна пасіка</h3>
        <p>Мед лише нашого виробництва, невеликими партіями.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="44" height="44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" /><path d="M16 2v4" /><path d="M8 2v4" /><path d="M3 10h18" /><path d="M9 16l2 2 4-4" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Свіжий мед 2026</h3>
        <p>Продаємо тільки мед цьогорічного врожаю.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="44" height="44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.69 17.66 8.35a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0L12 2.69z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Чистий мед</h3>
        <p>Без цукру та добавок.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="44" height="44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2" /><path d="M15 18H9" /><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14" /><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2" /><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Доставка по Україні</h3>
        <p>Нова пошта й Укрпошта, самовивіз у Сумах безкоштовно.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .benefits { padding-block: 2rem; background: var(--color-bg-alt); border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .benefits__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .benefits__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
  .benefit { text-align: center; }
  .benefit__icon { margin-bottom: .5rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-cta); }
  .benefit h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--color-brand); margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .benefit p { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .9rem; margin: 0; }
</style>
